.TH WEILER 6 2026-11-25 "Weiler 0.1.0" "Games"
.SH NAME
weiler \- settlement building game for touch screens, plays the data of the Gold Edition
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B weiler
.RB [ \-\-data
.IR folder ]
.RB [ \-\-fullscreen ]
.RB [ \-\-size
.IR W x H ]
.RB [ \-\-scale
.IR factor ]
.br
.B weiler
.B \-\-cd\-music
.I image
.B \-\-cd\-music\-out
.I folder
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Weiler
plays the classic settlement building game of 1996 from the data of its Gold Edition, by the original rules
(taken from Return to the Roots), with a new interface made for touch screens.
It works with touch, mouse and keyboard, in portrait and landscape.
.PP
The game data is not included.
Weiler looks for the folder that contains
.I DATA
and
.I GFX
in this order:
.BR \-\-data ,
the environment variable
.BR WEILER_DATA ,
the folder chosen earlier in the game, the package
.B weiler\-data
.RI ( /usr/share/games/weiler\-data/S2 ,
made by
.BR weiler\-pack\-data (6))
and
.IR $XDG_DATA_HOME/weiler/S2 .
Without data Weiler asks for the folder, searches it with all sub folders and remembers the result.
If the remembered folder is on a removable medium that is not inserted, Weiler shows its path and waits for
the medium.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-data " folder"
Folder with the game data (contains DATA and GFX).
.TP
.B \-\-fullscreen
Start in full screen mode.
.TP
.BI \-\-size " W" x H
Window size in pixels, e.g. 1080x2400.
.TP
.BI \-\-scale " factor"
Size of the interface (default: the scale of the display).
.TP
.BI \-\-cd\-music " image"
Convert the audio tracks of a CD image
.RI ( .ccd
or
.IR .cue )
to Ogg Vorbis files in the folder given by
.B \-\-cd\-music\-out
and quit (used by
.BR weiler\-pack\-data ).
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show all options, including those for tests
.RB ( \-\-script ,
.BR \-\-map ,
.BR \-\-load ).
.SH CONTROLS
Drag with one finger to move the map, pinch to zoom, tap with two fingers to go back.
Tap a building site to build, drag from a flag to lay a road, tap a building to open it.
With mouse and keyboard: right click or Esc goes back, Space pauses, + and \- change the speed,
F5 and F9 save and load quickly.
The introduction in the main menu shows the gestures step by step.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B WEILER_DATA
Folder with the game data.
.TP
.B WEILER_USERDATA
Folder for settings and savegames (default:
.IR $XDG_DATA_HOME/weiler ).
.TP
.B WEILER_APPDATA
Folder of the program data (default:
.I ../share/games/weiler
next to the program).
.TP
.B WEILER_UI_SCALE
Size of the interface, like
.BR \-\-scale .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/weiler/settings.ini
Settings, including the remembered folder of the game data.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/weiler/SAVE/
Savegames.
.TP
.I /usr/share/games/weiler/
Program data: fonts, music, the world descriptions and campaigns of Return to the Roots.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR weiler\-pack\-data (6)
